<title>INDIA: India's Kanoria Chemicals 96/97 net down.</title>
<headline>India's Kanoria Chemicals 96/97 net down.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     191.3  vs    220.3</p>
<p>    Net sales	    2,505.5  vs  2,443.4</p>
<p>    Div (percentage)	35    vs     25</p>
<p>NOTE: Kanoria Chemicals and Industries Ltd has interests in chemicals, power generation and textiles.</p>
<p>United News of India quoted the company's managing director, R.V. Kanoria, as attributing the fall in net profit to higher provision for tax and depreciation. It did not elaborate.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
